# rpg-api's allowlist (one module, at the repository root). Top-level tests
# allowed over the CI test budget (TEST_BUDGET in
# .github/workflows/test.yml). One test per line, as its package's import
# path, a slash and the test name, its reason after "#". An entry exempts
# that one package's test only. A slow test is a finding: size the fixture
# to the cases, or keep it here with a reason (rpg-project#907). The budget
# is judged on CI's timing: the seconds below are from CI run 42695344817's
# test.json (the test-json artifact), -race with atomic coverage.

